WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.453 --> 00:00:02.252
- [Voiceover] We are kicking off

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:04.760
season seven of American Ninja Warrior,

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.012
and we promise to bring you
some of the biggest stars

00:00:07.012 --> 00:00:08.637
on the planet, and these guys,

00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:10.100
the Try Guys from Buzzfeed.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.749
- I'm Matt Iseman, alongside former NFL

00:00:11.749 --> 00:00:14.117
defensive end Akbar Gbajabiamila.

00:00:14.117 --> 00:00:15.417
- [Akbar] Look, if you've
got the name Try Guys

00:00:15.417 --> 00:00:16.926
you gotta believe they're
gonna come out there

00:00:16.926 --> 00:00:18.529
and do their absolute best.

00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:19.736
- Well, a lot of the times
we've talked about it

00:00:19.736 --> 00:00:21.315
it's not necessarily the athletic ability.

00:00:21.315 --> 00:00:23.312
It's the courage, and
it's the determination.

00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:25.750
- (yells) No, no, no!

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.955
- (laughs) Could barely
keep a straight face.

00:00:27.955 --> 00:00:31.694
(dramatic music)

00:00:31.694 --> 00:00:33.366
- Ninja Warrior is one of the peak

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.734
fitness competitions in the world.

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:36.833
- I think it's all about brains.

00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:37.994
I think physical fitness is overrated.

00:00:37.994 --> 00:00:40.819
- Everything they do looks
impossible, and they fail at it.

00:00:40.819 --> 00:00:43.071
- My therapist said positive
thinking is really important.

00:00:43.071 --> 00:00:44.418
- I have no chance.

00:00:44.418 --> 00:00:46.479
(dramatic music)

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:47.468
- [Voiceover] No matter what, you guys

00:00:47.468 --> 00:00:50.055
