00:00:53.548 --> 00:00:54.087
- That's what I'm hearing.

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:56.107
- I think that you made that up.

00:00:56.107 --> 00:00:57.237
- I think that most of the audience

00:00:57.237 --> 00:00:58.184
isn't really quite familiar with

00:00:58.184 --> 00:00:59.776
the actual training involved, so

00:00:59.776 --> 00:01:01.168
