00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:03.741
- I started out with gymnastics

00:01:03.741 --> 00:01:05.180
when I was a lot younger, and then

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.131
transitioned into snowboarding and diving

00:01:07.131 --> 00:01:09.035
and trampolining, and
then freerunning parkour.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.936
- Let's see...

00:01:11.844 --> 00:01:15.025
