00:08:34.092 --> 00:08:36.275
with every telling, so hard though

00:08:36.275 --> 00:08:39.340
- [Akbar] What! You
gotta be able to grab on!

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:41.708
Look you saw, he wasn't
even able to get two hops!

00:08:41.708 --> 00:08:42.777
- That may have been one of the

00:08:42.777 --> 00:08:44.216
quickest failures we've ever seen.

00:08:44.216 --> 00:08:46.887
Let's take a look now, the
warped wall, the final obstacle!

00:08:46.887 --> 00:08:49.232
14 feet, and we are back to Ned.

00:08:49.232 --> 00:08:50.973
Try Guys having surprising success,

00:08:50.973 --> 00:08:53.643
can they get up this most iconic obstacle?

00:08:53.643 --> 00:08:54.827
- [Akbar] Alright, he's just testing out

00:08:54.827 --> 00:08:56.685
the warped wall, this
is a veteran move there.

00:08:56.685 --> 00:08:58.473
- [Matt] 14 feet against Eugene.

00:08:58.473 --> 00:09:01.584
- I can feel it. I am
literally sweating right now.

00:09:01.584 --> 00:09:03.302
This is the power of visualization.

00:09:03.302 --> 00:09:05.206
You've seen it, now do it.

00:09:05.206 --> 00:09:06.391
- [Matt] Building up the locomotive,

00:09:06.391 --> 00:09:09.920
I think, I can, oh!

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.986
One last attempt for Ned.

00:09:11.986 --> 00:09:13.588
- [Akbar] You're the Try Guys,

00:09:13.588 --> 00:09:15.283
this is the time when you have to try.

00:09:15.283 --> 00:09:16.630
- I haven't seen Ned look this bad

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.186
since I saw him in the lingerie.

00:09:18.186 --> 00:09:20.136
Get to the top and explode, last attempt!

00:09:20.136 --> 00:09:22.087
- [Akbar] Oh! No!

00:09:22.087 --> 00:09:25.291
- [Matt] Coming down, a
slide and it is over for Ned.

00:09:25.291 --> 00:09:26.893
Well even Zach was disappointed in Ned,

00:09:26.893 --> 00:09:28.077
and that's saying something.

00:09:28.077 --> 00:09:29.935
Now it all comes down to this, Eugene.

00:09:29.935 --> 00:09:32.465
One last attempt for
the Try Guys, 14 feet!

00:09:32.465 --> 00:09:34.091
- [Akbar] There he is, there he is!

00:09:34.091 --> 00:09:35.693
This kid has done it!

00:09:35.693 --> 00:09:37.202
- [Matt] Oh that move right there

00:09:37.202 --> 00:09:40.964
is big-time, prime-time,
show-time, all-time!

00:09:40.964 --> 00:09:43.680
- I am literally sweating
right now, can you see?

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.607
- This is, you are sweating profusely

00:09:45.607 --> 00:09:48.045
and I think what we just
saw is one of the greatest

00:09:48.045 --> 00:09:50.483
performances in the history
of American Ninja Warrior.

00:09:50.483 --> 00:09:53.664
He violated every rule
we have but I loved it.

00:09:53.664 --> 00:09:55.058
- [Akbar] Look at this,
they're going nuts!

00:09:55.058 --> 00:09:56.451
- [Matt] They look like
teenage girls who just saw

00:09:56.451 --> 00:09:58.401
NSYNC, what was that celebration?

00:09:58.401 --> 00:09:59.376
- I don't know.

00:09:59.376 --> 00:10:01.466
- I'm ashamed for them, but they did it!

00:10:01.466 --> 00:10:04.624
The Try Guys are American Ninja Warriors.

00:10:04.624 --> 00:10:06.946
- The relay team, where
it was okay to advance

00:10:06.946 --> 00:10:09.059
even if you failed, did the course.

00:10:09.059 --> 00:10:11.195
- If you could always
advance after failing,

00:10:11.195 --> 00:10:12.402
life would be great.

00:10:12.402 --> 00:10:13.168
- Yeah!

00:10:13.168 --> 00:10:15.374
- That's a great positive
attitude to have, right Zach?

00:10:15.374 --> 00:10:18.253
- My therapist was wrong,
positive thinking is bullshit.

00:10:18.253 --> 00:10:20.900
- I'd rather watch it on TV
while eating six frozen pizzas.

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:24.221
- Seeing this pinnacle of
achievement is so inspiring.

00:10:24.221 --> 00:10:26.334
I can see how people
dedicate their lives to this.

00:10:26.334 --> 00:10:29.097
- I am extra motivated, and
I'm coming back next year.

00:10:29.097 --> 00:10:31.210
- What will we try next?

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.742
- You want a towel?

00:10:32.742 --> 00:10:33.856
- Yes.

00:10:33.856 --> 00:10:36.132
- Well that's an unbelievable start

00:10:36.132 --> 00:10:37.757
to the season of American Ninja Warrior.

00:10:37.757 --> 00:10:39.661
The Try Guys have proven
they're do guys Akbar.

00:10:39.661 --> 00:10:41.333
- Try hard, or go home.

00:10:41.333 --> 00:10:42.494
- [Matt] One of the most amazing things

00:10:42.494 --> 00:10:43.794
about having these Try Guys out here

00:10:43.794 --> 00:10:46.743
is watching them with so
little training athletically,

00:10:46.743 --> 00:10:49.088
how much they've truly
tackled in their background,

00:10:49.088 --> 00:10:51.387
from UFC fighting to stripping.

00:10:51.387 --> 00:10:55.240
(laughter)

00:10:57.099 --> 00:10:59.144
- I think that's the end bump right there.

